+        """For a ticket loaded before the roles read `ticket.md`: write that file from the host's
+        copy of the ticket, give every stage card that has not run to its end the card text of
+        today, and put the ticket back behind the one before it in the queue (a ticket blocked at
+        triage is skipped by the queue, which is how it lost that link)."""
